{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"过早把离开的对象确定为一段亲密关系，并补出了失去熟悉陪伴和生活的具体原因。本屏只明确写了离开后的空落、说不清舍不得什么，以及缺乏向前的安稳感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把仍觉得那些委屈不该忍，进一步说成仍然认定离开没有错，原稿并没有确认离开的决定一定正确。另外，把思念对象确定为他们，忽略了原稿保留的某个人、故乡或旧生活等可能性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把暂时不回头的原因归结为不愿改变对旧委屈的认识，并认为亲近无法重新出现。本屏实际只表达了回忆带来的温暖不足以让他回头，以及回忆不能真正陪伴他，并没有明确交代这些因果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把舍不得被当作自己人缩窄成舍不得那些人，忽略了他也可能舍不得的是归属感。另外漏掉了一个重要变化：他这次开始从另一个角度理解过去那个不知所措的自己。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把这一屏的感受概括得过于平静、释然，漏掉了他仍害怕以后独自熬下去，也不愿仅仅为了有人陪伴就回头。原稿还强调了带着伤痕继续站立的意志，以及前进时仍有的不稳定感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把结尾理解成平静、从容、彻底释怀，弱化了原稿中被力量推着向前、几乎喘不过气的紧张感，以及刚建立的信心再次受到轻微质疑的状态。最后的和弦也保留了作出决定与突然从梦中醒来两种可能，并非单纯平静落定。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲的离开、怀念、孤独、反复权衡到带着想念继续生活的主线基本拼对了，但把原稿刻意保留的对象歧义收窄成一段亲密关系，也把结尾仍有紧张、犹疑和不确定性的情绪处理得过于平静圆满。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6f6142e6-1069-4b45-9283-5fb26d9046d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T033638831097Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:38:09.936207+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6568ceeae1d1fad8bbadca778e1027cb11d51a5af5020ee9638705fec88df32b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T033638831097Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c703f02ff1d4cc5c163a57cd3e08eb7afdc2bab561e3f6d72ab94aea91699d62"}}}
